			"Message": "chore(Deps/Tauri): Advance Tauri dependency tree and regenerate ecosystem index\n\nUpdate the Tauri submodule from c0a5acc6 to 14db5761, incorporating two upstream changes:\n\n- Regenerate README.md with comprehensive Tauri ecosystem repository index covering 50+ CodeEditorLand forked repositories including plugins (Authenticator, CLI, Dialog, FS, Http, Log, Notification, OS, Positioner, Process, SQL, Shell, Stronghold, Updater, Upload, WebSocket), tooling (TauriAction, TauriBindgen, TauriCon, TauriDocs, TauriToml, Tao, Wry), and auxiliary modules (TauriSearch, TauriTheia, WebView, Window utilities).\n- Apply permission table formatting standardization across Tauri core crates (app, event, image, menu, path, resources, tray, webview, window) and PluginsWorkspace, converting multi-line HTML table rows to uniform single-line tab-indented format with significant file size reductions while preserving all permission identifiers and descriptions.\n\nKeeps the Land editor's Tauri dependency tree current with upstream maintenance and improves documentation discoverability without altering semantic content.",
			"SHA": "12a75132e724a7496699da3fcac130468c768961"
		},
