			"Message": "chore(Deps/Tauri): Advance Tauri dependency submodule to upstream revision\n\nUpdate the Dependency submodule within the Tauri dependency tree to upstream\ncommit 07e24c9f, keeping the dependency tree current.\n\nThis continues ongoing dependency alignment with upstream Tauri maintenance\nwithout altering semantic content in the Land application layer.",
			"SHA": "b7396f23a7643294607872b7791f2acd99566e45"
